<title>CANADA: Dofasco Inc Q4 shr net rises after gain.</title>
<headline>Dofasco Inc Q4 shr net rises after gain.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Ontario 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.63		   C$0.53</p>
<p> Net			 60,000		   51,700</p>
<p> Revs		     719,500		  671,300</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$2.12		   C$1.98</p>
<p> Net			207,300		  195,800</p>
<p> Revs		   2,942,000		2,635,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Fourth quarter 1996 earnings were increased by about C$0.08 per share after a favourable adjustment related to a longstanding sales tax issue for Quebec Cartier Mining Co, in which Dofasco holds a 50-percent interest.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
